ntamination before launching, visit the <a href=\"https://cpw.state.co.us/activities/boat-inspections#4257225834-1617971122\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colorado Parks & Wildlife Mandatory Inspections</a> web page.</p>\n<p>Senior and Access passes provide a 50% discount on boat launch permits. Please note that other passes (Interagency Annual Pass, Military Pass, etc.) do not provide a discount for boat launch permits.</p>\n<p>All boaters are responsible for knowing the Boat Regulations and Safety Information for Curecanti NRA, which can be found by visiting the park's <a href=\"https://www.nps.gov/cure/planyourvisit/boating.htm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boating</a> web page. </p>\n<p>For current river and reservoir data, please visit the <a href=\"https://www.usbr.gov/uc/water/crsp/cs/asp.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bureau of Reclamation's Aspinall Unit Reservoirs</a> web page. </p>\n",
